 "npcs": [
  {
   "index": 0,
   "raw": "be0081b101000000",
   "x": 190,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 1,
   "headTile": "0xb1",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 0,
   "aiName": "look_at_hero_and_bob",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 0,
   "text": "Welcome to Dorado.\nThis was once a thriving merchant town where everyone lived a peaceful life. Jashiin has reduced it to a sad, desolate place."
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "raw": "b40084bb01060001",
   "x": 180,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 4,
   "headTile": "0xbb",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 6,
   "aiName": "bounce_2bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 1,
   "text": "The Spirits say that Jashiin returned because the people, made soft by peace and prosperity, sank into corruption."
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "raw": "8b00800001020002",
   "x": 139,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 2,
   "text": "Using the money and treasures of Dorado and other places, Jashiin built a place of his own. The Tesoro and Burata Caverns are his domain."
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "raw": "6900020001020003",
   "x": 105,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 3,
   "text": "A word to the wise: The door bearing the green symbol cannot be opened. There's no use trying to force it, it absolutely cannot be opened."
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "raw": "8800002901050004",
   "x": 136,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x29",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 5,
   "aiName": "bounce_1bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 4,
   "text": "Somewhere in the caverns are the Shirukaano shoes made by the shoemaker Percel. Try to find them; when you wear those shoes you can climb any slope."
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "raw": "6600806001030005",
   "x": 102,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x60",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 5,
   "text": "Someone who went into the caverns told me the Shirukaano shoes are hidden in Tesoro. Of the four rooms in the center, they are in the far right room."
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "raw": "5500800001050006",
   "x": 85,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 5,
   "aiName": "bounce_1bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 6,
   "text": "Of the four doors in Tesoro, three bear a blue symbol. What was the other one? For the life of me I can't remember."
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "raw": "9a00824f01070007",
   "x": 154,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x4f",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 7,
   "aiName": "static",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 7,
   "text": "This building wasn't here before, was it? You can't put up a building like this overnight -- how did it get here?"
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "raw": "380080a001050008",
   "x": 56,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 0,
   "headTile": "0xa0",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 5,
   "aiName": "bounce_1bit",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 8,
   "text": "A peace statue called 'Taruso' stood here, but one night it disappeared. Where in the world can it have gone? The evil Jashiin must have taken a liking to it."
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "raw": "240004bb01020009",
   "x": 36,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": false,
   "sprite": 4,
   "headTile": "0xbb",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 2,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_4th_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 9,
   "text": "I have a message from the Spirits: wait for the moving edge of the platform made of shining blocks."
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "raw": "7a0082000103000a",
   "x": 122,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 2,
   "headTile": "0x00",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 3,
   "aiName": "face_hero",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 10,
   "text": "When you find green stone slabs that can be moved up and down, arrange them like a staircase so you can go up easily."
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "raw": "150083450101000b",
   "x": 21,
   "headRow": 5,
   "facingLeft": true,
   "sprite": 3,
   "headTile": "0x45",
   "animPhase": 1,
   "ai": 1,
   "aiName": "patrol_every_2nd_tick",
   "flags": "0x00",
   "autoTalk": false,
   "blocksHero": false,
   "canTalk": true,
   "textIndex": 11,
   "text": "The middle of the caverns is made of pure gold! But there is one fake gold wall that can be destroyed."
  }
 ],
