  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "text": "Somewhere in the caverns are the Shirukaano shoes made by the shoemaker Percel. Try to find them; when you wear those shoes you can climb any slope.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "536f6d65776865726520696e207468652063617665726e7320617265207468652053686972756b61616e6f2073686f6573206d616465206279207468652073686f656d616b65722050657263656c2e2054727920746f2066696e64207468656d3b207768656e20796f7520776561722074686f73652073686f657320796f752063616e20636c696d6220616e7920736c6f70652e"
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "text": "Someone who went into the caverns told me the Shirukaano shoes are hidden in Tesoro. Of the four rooms in the center, they are in the far right room.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "536f6d656f6e652077686f2077656e7420696e746f207468652063617665726e7320746f6c64206d65207468652053686972756b61616e6f2073686f6573206172652068696464656e20696e205465736f726f2e204f662074686520666f757220726f6f6d7320696e207468652063656e7465722c20746865792061726520696e207468652066617220726967687420726f6f6d2e"
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "text": "Of the four doors in Tesoro, three bear a blue symbol. What was the other one? For the life of me I can't remember.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "4f662074686520666f757220646f6f727320696e205465736f726f2c2074687265652062656172206120626c75652073796d626f6c2e20576861742077617320746865206f74686572206f6e653f20466f7220746865206c696665206f66206d6520492063616e5c742072656d656d6265722e"
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "text": "This building wasn't here before, was it? You can't put up a building like this overnight -- how did it get here?",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "54686973206275696c64696e67207761736e5c742068657265206265666f72652c207761732069743f20596f752063616e5c74207075742075702061206275696c64696e67206c696b652074686973206f7665726e69676874202d2d20686f77206469642069742067657420686572653f"
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "text": "A peace statue called 'Taruso' stood here, but one night it disappeared. Where in the world can it have gone? The evil Jashiin must have taken a liking to it.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": ""
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "text": "I have a message from the Spirits: wait for the moving edge of the platform made of shining blocks.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "4920686176652061206d6573736167652066726f6d2074686520537069726974733a207761697420666f7220746865206d6f76696e672065646765206f662074686520706c6174666f726d206d616465206f66207368696e696e6720626c6f636b732e"
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "text": "When you find green stone slabs that can be moved up and down, arrange them like a staircase so you can go up easily.",
   "controlCodes": [],
   "raw": "5768656e20796f752066696e6420677265656e2073746f6e6520736c61627320746861742063616e206265206d6f76656420757020616e6420646f776e2c20617272616e6765207468656d206c696b6520612073746169726361736520736f20796f752063616e20676f20757020656173696c792e"
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "text": "The middle of the caverns is made of pure gold! But there is one fake gold wall that can be destroyed.",
